{"id":"rad_counter.1","n":"rad_counter","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"freeradius-utils","ver":"3.0.21-44.el9_6","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/f/freeradius-utils-3.0.21-44.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/rad_counter.1.gz","sha256":"aae65729e02557cb4a70e9a72d2595f7534e7358e3049cbc6d08c07f85aa44a5","date":"19 September 2016","origin":""},"u":{"pkg":"freeradius-common","ver":"3.0.26~dfsg~git20220223.1.00ed0241fa-0ubuntu3.4","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/f/freeradius/freeradius-common_3.0.26~dfsg~git20220223.1.00ed0241fa-0ubuntu3.4_all.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/rad_counter.1.gz","sha256":"7152acca806902ca2c2029bce28c96d1b30ba88989f27a2585dfa3f47f8b8078","date":"19 September 2016","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":5,"u":5},"miss":{"r":["--hours","--minutes","--seconds"],"u":["--hours","--minutes","--seconds"]},"desc":"Query and maintain FreeRADIUS rlm_counter DB file. This tool is deprecated","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>rad_counter - Query and maintain FreeRADIUS rlm_counter DB file.</p> <p>This tool is deprecated</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>rad_counter</b> [<b>--file</b> <i>counter_filename</i>] [<b>--user</b> <i>username</i>] [<b>--match</b> <i>&lt;regex&gt;</i>] [<b>--reset</b> <i>number]</i> [<b>--help</b>] [<b>--hours</b>|<b>--minutes</b>|<b>--seconds</b>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>rad_counter</b> is a tool that can query and maintain FreeRADIUS rlm_counter DB files.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\">--file=</dt><dd>Counter DB filename.</dd><dt data-o=\"\">--user= <i>username</i></dt><dd>Information for specific user.</dd><dt data-o=\"\">--match= <i>&lt;regex&gt;</i></dt><dd>Information for matching users.</dd><dt data-o=\"\">--reset= <i>number</i></dt><dd>Reset counter to &lt;number&gt;. If divisor is set use it, else &lt;number&gt; means seconds.</dd><dt data-o=\"\">--help</dt><dd>Show the help screen.</dd><dt>--(hours | minutes | seconds)</dt><dd>Specify information divisor.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>radiusd(8)</p>"],["AUTHORS","<p>Alan DeKok &lt;aland@freeradius.org&gt;</p>"]]}